A recommendation is a category-A-recommendation and is an evidence-type-4-recommendation.
If a clinician starts an opioid-therapy for an acute-pain then the clinician should prescribe an immediate-release-opioid instead-of an ER-LA-opioid.
If a clinician starts an opioid-therapy for a subacute-pain then the clinician should prescribe an immediate-release-opioid instead-of an ER-LA-opioid.
If a clinician starts an opioid-therapy for a chronic-pain then the clinician should prescribe an immediate-release-opioid instead-of an ER-LA-opioid.
